            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The authors examined the spatial density of groundwater wells in 17 western states, and their depths and purposes, stitching together well completion records across numerous jurisdictional boundaries. This information was used to approximate where wells are impacted by declining groundwater levels.",
